{"sections":[{"slug":"Pauli矩阵","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Pauli矩阵"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Pauli <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Pauli 矩阵”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Pauli <span lang=\"zh\">矩阵是</span></p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\sigma^0 = \\begin{pmatrix}\r\n    1 &amp; 0 \\\\\r\n    0 &amp; 1\r\n\\end{pmatrix},\r\n\\sigma^1 = \\begin{pmatrix}\r\n    0 &amp; 1 \\\\\r\n    1 &amp; 0\r\n\\end{pmatrix},\r\n\\sigma^2 = \\begin{pmatrix}\r\n    0 &amp; -i \\\\\r\n    i &amp; 0\r\n\\end{pmatrix},\r\n\\sigma^3 = \\begin{pmatrix}\r\n    1 &amp; 0 \\\\\r\n    0 &amp; -1\r\n\\end{pmatrix}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">也有人将</span> $i\\sigma^1$ <span lang=\"zh\">记作</span> $\\sigma^1$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数的关系</span></h3>\n<p>$i\\sigma^1,i\\sigma^2,i\\sigma^3$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $\\mathfrak {su}(2)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的基</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">代数有</span> $\\mathfrak {su}(2)\\simeq \\mathfrak {so}(3)$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">交换关系</span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">交换关系</span>: $[i\\sigma^1,i\\sigma^2] = -2i\\sigma^3$ (<span lang=\"zh\">轮换</span>).</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">反交换关系</span>: $\\{i\\sigma^1,i\\sigma^1\\}=-2$, $\\{i\\sigma^1,i\\sigma^2\\}=0$. <span lang=\"zh\">这构成</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Clifford代数","text":"Clifford <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\text{Cl}_{0,3}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个表示</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自旋","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自旋</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}